---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.tsx';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Halvard Mørstad">
  <PageHeader current="about" />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="mb-6" style="padding-right: 40px;">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-2">
      <p class="font-medium m-0 text-heading" style="font-size: 20px;">Halvard Mørstad</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a href="https://github.com/halvardssm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="GitHub">
          <Icon name="brand-github" size={16} color="var(--color-dim)" />
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/halvard-mørstad-4b8b13144/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn">
          <Icon name="brand-linkedin" size={16} color="var(--color-dim)" />
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:halvard@morstad.eu" aria-label="Email">
          <Icon name="mail" size={16} color="var(--color-dim)" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;">
      I help founders and business leaders turn ideas into working software —
      without needing a technical team in place yet.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA buttons -->
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mb-8">
    <a href="mailto:halvard@morstad.eu" class="btn-primary" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 13px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;">
      Get in touch
    </a>
    <a href="/work" class="btn-outline" style="padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 13px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;">
      View my work
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Link back to technical version -->
  <a href="/" class="btn-outline" style="padding: 10px 18px; font-size: 13px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 2rem; text-decoration: none;">
    <Icon name="click" size={20} color="var(--color-link)" />
    <span>Are you a developer? See the technical version here</span>
  </a>

  <!-- The problem -->
  <div class="mb-8">
    <p class="m-0 mb-2 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">The problem I solve</p>
    <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
      You have a vision, a market, maybe even early customers — but you need
      someone who can build the product, make the right technical decisions, and
      eventually hand it off to a team. Hiring a full engineering team on day one
      is expensive and risky. You need someone who can bridge the gap between
      "this is what we want to build" and "this is how we build it."
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- How I can help -->
  <div class="mb-8" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding-top: 1.25rem;">
    <p class="m-0 mb-2.5 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">How I can help</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <div class="card" style="padding: 1rem;">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
          <Icon name="code" size={16} color="#85b7eb" />
          <p class="font-medium m-0 text-heading" style="font-size: 14px;">Your technical co-founder</p>
        </div>
        <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
          I build the first version of your product myself — frontend, backend,
          and everything in between. You get a working product to show investors
          and customers without hiring a team first. When the time comes to scale,
          I help you hire and onboard your first engineers.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding: 1rem;">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
          <Icon name="bulb" size={16} color="#f0997b" />
          <p class="font-medium m-0 text-heading" style="font-size: 14px;">Your interim CTO</p>
        </div>
        <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
          If you already have a team but no technical leader, I step in to set
          direction, establish processes, and make sure the engineering is on
          track. I stay until you've found the right permanent hire — then I hand
          over cleanly.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding: 1rem;">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
          <Icon name="users" size={16} color="#97c459" />
          <p class="font-medium m-0 text-heading" style="font-size: 14px;">Your technical advisor</p>
        </div>
        <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
          Sometimes you just need a second opinion. I help you evaluate whether
          your current setup makes sense, what to build next, and whether you're
          spending money on the right things. No commitment, no retainer — just
          straight answers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <div class="flex gap-6 py-4" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <div>
      <span class="text-heading font-medium" style="font-size: 20px;">~10</span>
      <span class="block text-dim" style="font-size: 11px;">years experience</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="text-heading font-medium" style="font-size: 20px;">8</span>
      <span class="block text-dim" style="font-size: 11px;">people led</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="text-heading font-medium" style="font-size: 20px;">25+</span>
      <span class="block text-dim" style="font-size: 11px;">projects delivered</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- What it's like to work with me -->
  <div class="mt-8 mb-8">
    <p class="m-0 mb-3 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">What it's like to work with me</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
        <span class="text-dim">— </span>I speak human, not jargon. You'll always
        know what we're building, why, and what it costs — no surprise bills or
        mysterious technical debt.
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
        <span class="text-dim">— </span>I build things that last. The product I
        hand you isn't a prototype held together with tape — it's something your
        future team can understand, maintain, and build on.
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
        <span class="text-dim">— </span>I'm honest about what you need and what
        you don't. If something isn't worth building, I'll tell you before you pay
        for it.
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
        <span class="text-dim">— </span>I mentor the people I work with. If you
        have junior developers, I'll grow them. If you don't have a team yet, I'll
          help you hire one.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- On AI -->
  <div class="mb-8" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding-top: 1.25rem;">
    <p class="m-0 mb-2 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">On AI</p>
    <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
      AI won't replace your engineers — but it changes what they spend time on.
      Instead of writing every line from scratch, they evaluate, guide, and
      verify what the tools produce. I use AI to speed up delivery and reduce
      cost where it makes sense, but I won't pretend it's a substitute for
      judgment. Applied well, it accelerates your timeline. Applied blindly, it
      creates a mess that costs more to fix than it saved.
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 text-muted mt-3" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
      I help teams adopt AI where it actually pays off — integrating it into
      their workflows, setting guardrails so output is reviewed rather than
      trusted blindly, and making sure the time saved shows up on the bottom line
      rather than in a pile of technical debt.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Metrics -->
  <div class="mb-8" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding-top: 1.25rem;">
    <p class="m-0 mb-2.5 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">Track record</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="text-heading font-medium" style="font-size: 20px; min-width: 60px;">60%</span>
        <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">deploy time reduction for a client infra migration — from hours to minutes.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding-top: 0.75rem;">
        <span class="text-heading font-medium" style="font-size: 20px; min-width: 60px;">0 → 8</span>
        <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">engineers hired and mentored to build out a team from scratch.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding-top: 0.75rem;">
        <span class="text-heading font-medium" style="font-size: 20px; min-width: 60px;">6 mo</span>
        <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">typical time from idea to a product you can show investors and customers.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding-top: 0.75rem;">
        <span class="text-heading font-medium" style="font-size: 20px; min-width: 60px;">~10</span>
        <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">years across startups and enterprise, from prototype to production at scale.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- About -->
  <div class="pt-5 mb-6" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <p class="m-0 mb-2 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">About me</p>
    <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8;">
      I've spent the last ten years building software across startups and
      enterprise — from early prototypes to production systems serving real users.
      I've led teams, mentored engineers, and worked independently with clients
      who needed someone they could trust with the technical side of their
      business. I also mentor junior engineers and previously taught
      programming, because I believe good engineering should be accessible to
      more people.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="pt-3.5" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <p class="m-0 text-dim" style="font-size: 11px;">© Halvard Mørstad</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
